UID:266279@scout-event-finder
DTSTAMP:20261026T165207Z
DTSTART:20270711T170000Z
DTEND:20270717T140000Z
SUMMARY:Camp Hiawatha Scouts BSA Resident Camp 2027 – Session 1
LOCATION:Camp Hiawatha\, Munising\, Michigan
DESCRIPTION:Michigan Crossroads Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/
 272-CHSBSA27\n\n\n\nLive the Adventure.\nCamp Hiawatha Scout Summer Camp 
 provides a GREAT 6 night / 6 day OUTDOOR ADVENTURE for Scouts BSA & Ventu
 ring Scouts\, their trusted adults and leaders nestled on the shores of b
 eautiful Bunting Lake between the towns of Munising and Chathama\, MI in 
 the Hiawatha National Forest.\nCamp amenities include a shower house\, 
 flush latrines in all campsites\, water and meals served by means of patr
